  "title": "Knedlíky (Czech Bread Dumplings)",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s simmered knedlíky, or Czech bread dumplings, make the ultimate comforting dish when served with gravy on top.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-04-05T09:00:00-04:00",
