  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup warm milk (105 degrees F (40 degrees C))",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon active dry yeast",
    "1 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1 large egg, beaten",
    "2.75 cups quick-mixing flour (such as Wondra®), or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ITsoODalIZjF3AKPRBhTTQbj2AQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-ingredients-2-420ac55ac54c46daa96700c28bba6b92.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine warm milk, sugar, and yeast in a bowl. Let sit and bloom for about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4heX_B4LCIKmQ2oVmDQ8grqecXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-01-bfff6ab997d846349a0bbf6b08d9b742.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add egg and kosher salt to the yeast mixture. Pour in 2 ¾ cups flour. Stir with a wooden spoon until it starts to pull away from the sides of the bowl and forms a dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cQilvTKESgv--DRa0umxTJS5Mwg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-02-2-855830458b0e4c319fecf3bd0cff68cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead on a lightly floured surface until dough is smooth and slightly elastic, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O9yLYoSNNNdqvWlGrFT_-f1uWFw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-03-59483f34ae464704be4f0de2acc94a46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a lightly oiled bowl, flipping the dough to coat the top in oil. Cover and let rise in a warm spot until doubled in size, about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jVMFyGTNc83Kn2RoAIlXgE8Thbk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-04-5263f65cb55c4a4484cd11466ea2e126.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer back to your work surface; press out the excess air and form dough into a relatively uniform ball.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8SpvBAvGeMnfATy8cxl0ejMJU74=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-05-9d28d9f9ad8541569564114f18479a56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut dough into two equal pieces. Form each piece into a uniform ball. Roll each ball into a tube, 2 to 2 ½ inches wide. Cover with plastic wrap or a clean kitchen towel and let proof for 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YEeXZXBh0VI6vvXxQaNXmbVw3hQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-06-a803b3292ae048b6b8c6182d837e8e67.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring a large pot of salted water to a steady simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xmMb1q7hM9dFf9Hf8KjxzMMOfcs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-07-547dbb49425b4cd1ba60cb1ec198fb93.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully pick up a risen piece of dough and transfer to the simmering water. Bring back to a simmer. Cover tightly and let simmer for 10 minutes. Uncover, flip, and continue to simmer for another 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E2OW4Z9tEVbmUA_u1uzmfVle2vs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-09-e1c17727bfa6433584d99ba84bea6d22.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a plate and poke all over with a toothpick or wooden skewer, which releases the steam from the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I4ILmaE47o7IQiP-LFJj4suiuWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-10-1-c2212b7fb4584245968f7a9e56285983.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a piece of string or thread to cut into 3/4- to 1-inch dumplings. Transfer to a serving plate. Repeat Steps 9 to 11 to cook remaining dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TU5TADAVIfpEB8lxKXZ1f3q0k5k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-step-11-2-0baac9d85a4843f9a0ee3220d40af908.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qKyvkxIyWedShcF2B-huXaMaCJI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-8374896-czech-bread-dumplings-knedliky-VAT-4x3-2-40457e8f0e064d5fb45abfd3abf7d561.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8374896/step_12.webp"
    }
  ],
